        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: end lnet-selftest smoke when batch completes",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: end lnet-selftest smoke when batch completes\n\ntest_smoke waited the whole smoke_DURATION (300s with\nSLOW=no) after starting the batch. On x86 test VMs the batch\ncompletes its loops in about 90s and the test spends the\nrest idle.\n\nPoll the batch every 10s and stop waiting once it has\nstopped, with smoke_DURATION still the limit.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=lnet-selftest\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I84c0d949b6e671be81288510b39ebc589f21f025\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69666\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
